 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=69yHlVmDdkkQ7kNvwGpCIEr&_nc_oc=AdqG9harURTWpvRPsDeQnXdAD1cmkJERJM2aFz4WyTKHR9WnzMFtbcJeq1lX3IXCIOY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKmXSwe_-s-8VpIa0bNfQFACLSDW-c40w1qroDre1kqdg&oe=6ABD2841"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JrB77YIwoc8Q7kNvwFtgo3_&_nc_oc=AdpkeOYdRWE6bNY-B3WXnl9DIqRhI6XhGX1PegVxVigcfdxsMfuZ39pNOrYeroMKbu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJxwh7QwHvQLulLM5BCI7dmdQtKoo-rWOe9VjUCygBLKA&oe=6ABD35A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iGDptrJhPfQQ7kNvwGNffXc&_nc_oc=AdqQyS2iLWQC0vZDYBPQt7sjLkthwyI0wrkk5ZlGM5OmqiR8ohtY15FULvby_zXTXlI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLCFtKISpgNIC_Y3HD1fQW25Lnzh6wS3WFI_Or5InrO_w&oe=6ABD075C"}, {"fil